WEBVTT

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.140
There, done.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:06.870
Is it cute?

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.480
Yeah, it's cute.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.450
Does my nape excite you?

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.530
Yeah, it does.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.210
<i>Wh-What should I do?</i>

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:17.060
A-Anyway, what are you going to do now?

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:19.370
We're going to continue 
practicing love, of course.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.590
<i>"Practicing love"?</i>

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.760
<i>What does that mean?</i>

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.750
<i>What is the president talking about?</i>

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.040
Yeah, it looks good.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:27.880
<i>What?!</i>

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:30.020
You're spinning too fast
 for me to see, though.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.720
<i>Impossible. The president...</i>

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.090
<i>The president everyone admires is...</i>

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.020
I feel sick.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.730
Are you stupid?!

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:45.280
If those girls who look up to you 
could see you now, they'd cry.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:47.850
If that ever happened...

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.280
I'd cry first.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.370
I-I'm sorry.

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:01.060
Hey, wait!

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.850
Was that the first-year secretary?

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:07.170
That's a fairy.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.000
That was a fairy.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.550
<i>What should I do? What should I do?</i>

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.080
<i>What should I do?!</i>

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:51.800
<b>The Shy, the Cool, and the Perverted?</b>

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.060
Hey.

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:53.620
It's been two days.

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:55.150
Maybe everything's fine now.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.610
No, I'm done for.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.070
I'm finished!

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:05.280
Come on, you can practice your 
embraces with your beloved Huggy.

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.870
W-Well, I mean, you're always...

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.820
Oh, hell!

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:18.850
It'll be fine.

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:20.630
She didn't even laugh at you.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:23.340
It would have been 
better if she had laughed.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:24.260
Huh?

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:29.270
I'd rather she had laughed instead 
of running away like that.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.000
She scorned me.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:33.870
She was such a good girl, too.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.780
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:44.270
Hey, Suzu, are you friends 
with the president yet?

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.390
Lucky you.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:47.620
Kurahashi-senpai joined the 
student council too, right?

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:51.680
Suzu?

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.080
You've been acting weird lately.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:57.260
Are you having trouble 
with Kurahashi-senpai?

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:58.090
D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.680
I look up to the Wild Kid!

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.380
I call her "the W-K" for short!

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:04.900
"The Wacky"?

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:06.710
Are you sure you look up to her?

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.890
Did something else happen, then?

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.310
Well...

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:16.820
<i>I saw their secret and ran away 
even though they tried to stop me.</i>

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:18.350
<i>I'm the worst.</i>

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.420
<i>They must be angry.</i>

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.050
Is Tanahashi Suzune here?

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.010
The Wild...

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:28.120
The Wild...

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.330
Wild... Wild... Wild...

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.250
<i>What are they chanting?</i>

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:38.590
W... W... W-K!

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:39.670
Suzu?

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:41.130
"Wacky"?

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.240
<i>Stupid, stupid, stupid!</i>

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:46.560
<i>I ran away again.</i>

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.560
<i>But my body just moved on its own.</i>

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:51.210
Tanahashi?

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.260
You're in here, right?

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:56.110
I-I'm sorry! I suddenly felt a big one coming...

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.470
R-Right.

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.180
Listen...

00:04:59.300 --> 00:04:59.940
Y-Yes.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:02.610
Why were you hiding in 
the student council room?

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.800
I-I wasn't hiding.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.000
I didn't mean to hide.

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:12.620
I'm not brave enough to face you two, so...

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:23.040
I meant to leave my paperwork there 
while you were gone that day, but...

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:34.420
So, what should we practice today?

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.730
So, I...

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:41.300
I see.

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.650
That's how you ended 
up seeing everything.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:44.600
I'm sorry!

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:47.270
I won't tell anyone, 
so please forgive me!

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:50.110
Look, you don't need to apologize.

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:53.660
But could you come talk to Maki?

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:54.240
What?

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.520
She's really worried about it.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.840
She thinks you scorned her.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:05:59.990
N-Never!

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:02.480
I would never scorn the president.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.250
I'm the one who...

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:08.850
Yeah, so why don't you tell her that?

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:12.350
Well, good luck dropping that big one.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.350
<b>After School</b>

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:21.120
<i>I hadn't considered how 
the president feels.</i>

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:22.980
<i>I should apologize to her.</i>

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.790
E-Excuse me!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.700
<i>They're not here yet.</i>

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.850
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:40.250
<i>I could do some cleaning 
until they get here.</i>

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.070
Huggy!

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:49.830
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.640
<i>I didn't pay attention to 
where I put that away!</i>

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.980
Huggy is cheating on me!

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:55.850
That's what you're worried about?

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:58.730
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:08.010
My glasses... my glasses...

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:11.620
Glasses... glasses...

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.180
Ouch!

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:19.470
<i>They must be disgusted with me.</i>

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:22.950
<i>I came to apologize, but there's 
no way I can do it now.</i>

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:24.210
<i>They must hate me.</i>

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:33.390
President?

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.300
Tanahashi-san.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.220
Will you be my master of clumsiness?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.350
What?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.270
What's a master of clumsiness?

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.720
<i>Student Council President Maki Natsuo.</i>

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:46.570
<i>Popular among teachers and students alike,</i>

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.530
<i>works with speed and precision,</i>

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.820
<i>and is even considerate.</i>

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:51.340
Thank you for your hard work, Sensei.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.240
<i>A perfect and faultless girl.</i>

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:58.840
<i>But, she commits a serious 
blunder once every six months.</i>

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:00.650
How does that sound?

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:01.750
Doesn't sound like anything.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.530
Come on, Riko.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.290
It's all about the gap.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:08.010
People who have it together 
sometimes make mistakes.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:10.210
You told me I couldn't get

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.900
attention from boys if I didn't 
do clumsy things sometimes.

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:16.090
You still haven't given up 
on being a clumsy girl?

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:18.570
For example, I could 
release doves from my bag.

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:19.430
Are you a magician?!

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:23.100
While gracefully trying to make 
some tea, a bunch of flags pop out!

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.010
Those are magic tricks!

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:28.100
Normally, you'd accidentally make 
green tea instead of black tea,

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:31.280
or put in salt instead of sugar.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.860
That's just nonsensical.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:35.510
And what's your idea of "sense"?

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:38.500
Real clumsiness doesn't require special tricks.

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:41.950
I don't think I can be 
clumsy without using tricks.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:45.580
You could call that thought itself clumsy.

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:51.210
I-I'm sorry, but you're just so funny...

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.390
I'm sorry about the other day.

00:08:57.710 --> 00:09:01.060
Were you disappointed to learn how I really am?

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.710
I was surprised then,

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.230
but I think the difference between 
that and your usual behavior is cute.

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:08.790
That's great.

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:09.940
I told you so, Riko.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.300
The answer is in the gap.

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:14.720
Let's practice approaching 
people using the gap.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:15.900
Don't get ahead of yourself.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.830
Are you talking about practicing love?

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.300
That's right.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.950
Riko, the master of love, is instructing me.

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:25.370
H-Hey!

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:26.480
Master?

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:27.750
That's right.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.420
She's made countless boyfriends 
fall in love with her.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:32.530
That's amazing!

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:35.970
I can't talk to boys at all!

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.160
<i>It's wrong to lie.</i>

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:39.680
<i>I should tell the truth.</i>

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:40.720
Listen...

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:47.100
<b>Can't bear to disappoint them</b>

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.590
I thought you were both out of reach,

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:52.560
but you're just as interested 
in love as we are.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.440
It makes me kind of happy!

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:59.530
I'm glad to have someone who 
accepts me for who I really am.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:04.620
<b>Conscience</b>

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.470
Friendships are born from truth, aren't they?

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.270
I must maintain my position, 
so don't tell anyone.

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:10.880
But let's agree never to 
lie to each other here.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:11.990
I agree!

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:15.460
My mother always told me 
thieves start out as liars.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:19.160
You don't look well, Riko.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.260
Don't worry about it.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:23.260
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.370
Senpai!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:27.140
Oh, Tanahashi.

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:30.540
What do you think the president 
is going to practice today?

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:31.760
Who knows?

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:34.110
I'm sure it'll be something stupid again.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.430
Dealing comebacks to her is hard work.

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:37.660
Well, actually...

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:41.300
I thought it might be difficult, 
so I made this for you.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:42.660
Made what?

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:43.830
Here.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.060
You're ruthless, aren't you?

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:51.380
Maki!

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:52.960
President!

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:55.530
Hey, Maki! Wake up!

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:57.260
Should I call an ambulance?

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:00.980
Please carry me like a princess.

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:03.860
So?

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:05.230
What was that about?

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:07.560
I wanted to practice being carried...

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:09.900
Every maiden longs to be in that situation.

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:13.060
Through fields, mountains, 
and the 53 Stations of the Tokaido.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.150
Is he a courier?

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:18.400
You always come up with 
the most ridiculous ideas.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.570
How original.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:20.070
Huh?

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:23.740
You've never wanted to be 
carried like a princess?

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.410
<b>Have</b>

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:31.120
The typical situation in which a girl is 
carried is when she loses consciousness.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.290
So, that's what you were practicing.

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:36.150
But, I've never lost consciousness before.

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:38.130
I wonder what it's like?

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:39.980
I've never lost consciousness, either.

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:42.040
When you actually lose consciousness...

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:46.720
Some people smirk with the 
whites of their eyes showing.

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:52.100
Uh, um... I wonder what it 
feels like to be carried?

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:54.590
Maybe something like this?

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:57.090
When you actually lose consciousness,

00:11:57.090 --> 00:12:01.780
you're apparently extremely heavy 
and may have to be carried like this.

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:05.720
You can hear them chanting, 
"Heave-ho, heave-ho."

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:05.720
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho...

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:07.640
Let's not talk about passing out any more!

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:08.680
Yeah!

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:10.660
It's rude to make light of it!

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:13.880
Let's go with spraining your ankle 
and being unable to move, then.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:17.130
Ouch! I sprained my ankle!

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.300
That was sudden.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.740
Is someone willing to carry me?

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.300
Don't just wait for someone to carry you!

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.080
I thought it would make me easier to carry...

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:25.930
Don't worry about that.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:27.970
Instead of being so eager,

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.280
you should act embarrassed 
and refuse his offer once.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:34.090
You'll try to stand your ground, 
but he'll insist on carrying you.

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:36.900
He might even tell you, "You're so light."

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:38.770
How specific.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:41.200
<i>Sh-Shoot!</i>

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.520
<i>I've fantasized about it so much, I just...</i>

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:45.530
Oh, I know!

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.600
You're describing your experience to us.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.620
You truly are a master.

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:52.080
I want someone to tell me I'm light!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.790
Tell me how to make someone think 
I'm cute while they're carrying me!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.840
I guess I don't have a choice!

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:04.050
<i>I'm an idiot!</i>

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.470
How can you make yourself feel lighter?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.300
<i>How would I know?</i>

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:10.520
Tighten your stomach as much as you can.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:12.850
That'll make you feel lighter!

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.110
Maybe...

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:14.840
Okay!

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:16.020
How can you make yourself seem cute?

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:17.480
<i>I'd like to know!</i>

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:21.400
S-Start by facing downwards.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.150
Okay!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.470
Th-Then, um...

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.530
Raise your head from time to time, and...

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:28.910
Use your eyes!

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.280
Your eyes?

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:32.240
That's right, your eyes.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.740
If you can communicate with 
your eyes, he'll think you're cute.

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:35.720
Maybe...

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:36.660
Okay!

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:39.080
Let's practice. Stomach!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:39.870
Stomach!

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.000
Eyes!

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:41.840
Eyes!

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:43.040
Stomach!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.060
Stomach!

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:45.090
Eyes!

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.290
Eyes!

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:58.700
What's wrong?

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:02.290
Lately, I feel like I'm being watched.

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:04.110
Maybe it's just my imagination.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.920
It's Kurahashi-senpai.

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:06.950
So wild...

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.450
It's the Wild Kid.

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:13.370
<i>I don't think that's imaginary, 
nor a recent development.</i>

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:21.960
Watch out!

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:27.130
The Wild—

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.340
What is this?

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.760
Harassment?

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:34.180
Maybe. I'm not sure.

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.890
<b>You slim girl!!!</b>

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:38.180
I'm not sure, either.

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:39.550
I know, right?

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:46.280
I found this in the papers 
I got from the teacher.

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:47.930
<b>Maki Natsuo is too slim!!!</b>

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:50.110
My, more harassment?

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.620
I can see you smiling.

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:01.710
Third-year, Enomoto Yuiko.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.880
Relatively cute,

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:07.550
decent grades, and reasonably talented.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.620
More or less trusted by those around her.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:12.720
She is an average person.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:15.660
Could you lay off the
half-baked compliments?

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:18.950
Anyway, they don't seem hurt at all.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:20.560
Are you sure you went to check, Sayo?

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.060
I knew something wasn't right.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:25.880
There's no way they're 
trying to build muscle.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.730
But, that's what I heard.

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:29.120
Stomach!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:30.360
Eyes!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.610
Wh-What?

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:33.830
Those are the words I heard.

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:35.780
It sounded like strengthening exercises.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:38.300
How does that mean they're 
interested in bodybuilding?

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:42.670
In any case, I'm certain 
they're up to no good.

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:45.960
We'll gather evidence and expose 
them to the whole school.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.740
Then it will be clear...

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:50.900
The student council president 
should not be Maki Natsuo,

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.630
but me, Enomoto Yuiko.

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:03.110
Just hearing you laugh makes 
you sound like a villain.

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:04.060
What?

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:06.980
Huh? There's something written on the back.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:08.850
Low-ranking Member

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:08.850
Vice President

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.950
Mine says...

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:12.500
What is this?

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.950
I'm not low-ranking if I'm a member.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.900
Could this one be a mistake?

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:18.400
It says, "vice president."

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.000
What terrible harassment.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:21.540
What?

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:25.880
Now that I think of it, Maki-senpai 
is only the acting president.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.570
Oh, right. You mentioned 
something like that.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:31.800
I see, so that's why it says vice president.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.220
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.860
No way. Really?

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:38.550
Really, really. She was laughing—

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:39.500
You there.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.850
Keep your voices down in the hallway!

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:44.240
S-Sorry.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.710
Sheesh.

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:48.780
Who was that?

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:50.970
She's a third-year student,
 Enomoto-senpai.

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:53.860
You know, the one who resigned to 
let Princess Fuji be the president.

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.950
I didn't resign!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.040
Eno, keep your voice down in the hallway.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.420
This sucks!

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:03.440
They're acting like I'm a thing of the past.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:06.210
I'm still the actual student council president!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.970
In that case, all you need to do is 
announce you're returning to your position.

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:12.380
Once you do that, you 
won't have to spy on them

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.220
with binoculars every day like a pervert.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.360
That's not it!

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.150
Yesterday was only the second time!

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:18.680
I'm not a pervert!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.850
<i>She sounds like a pervert 
trying to make excuses.</i>

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.640
I tried to settle things amicably,

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.850
but our faculty advisor said...

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:30.820
What? B-But Maki-san has 
become quite well established.

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:35.020
I-I mean, it's not as though 
there's anything wrong with you.

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:36.560
But, you know...

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:37.500
Right?

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:42.410
While I was spying on them, I noticed 
they were doing something weird!

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.660
Spying on people is 
something perverts do, right?

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:45.800
No!

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:48.180
I just want to find their weakness!

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:50.340
Don't you want to go back 
to being the treasurer?

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:55.110
I did finish allocating the club
 budgets for major events,

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.560
so I don't really care.

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:58.680
What? Don't you like calculating money?

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:01.300
I don't like calculating, I like money!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.850
Intangible calculations are like torture.

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:07.070
<i>Sayo seems kind of dangerous sometimes.</i>

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:09.870
<i>But, I need her to be more 
serious about helping me.</i>

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.510
The club budgets have been allocated,

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:17.070
but there's going to be a provisional 
budget for the summer festival.

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:19.050
If you go back to being 
the treasurer now,

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:20.870
there will be plenty of 
cash for you to touch.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.690
I must return to my position somehow.

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:27.530
All right.

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.270
Until now, I'd just been following you

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:32.310
because it was amusing 
to watch your perversion.

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:33.630
I told you, I'm not a pervert!

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:35.840
But I'm going to take this 
seriously from now on!

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:38.450
I'm telling you, I'm not a pervert!

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:39.600
Are you listening to me?

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:41.850
Why do they keep shouting about perverts?

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.340
Hey, are you listening to me?

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:44.110
She said she loves money.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.280
Why are you just laughing?

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:46.520
Is that why she quit the student council?

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:47.540
Just who do you think I am, anyway?

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:48.590
<b>Damaging their own reputations 
more than their enemies'</b>

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:48.600
Hey!

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:52.320
Maybe you're taking those 
harassing notes too seriously.

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:55.230
But just in case it is someone like that,

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:58.530
I'm going to work even 
harder, so they'll give up.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.700
You're trying to do things yourself again.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:01.890
It's all right.

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:03.090
I'm talented.

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:05.530
Besides, once the harassment stops...

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:08.410
I can practice love feeling refreshed.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:10.980
Refreshed?

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:12.430
Oh, right.

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:15.320
There's that treasurer you 
banished from the room, right?

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:17.880
If you ask her to come back, your work...

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:22.660
I know who's behind the harassment.

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:23.180
What?

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:26.120
It's the treasurer, Mizushima-senpai.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.810
She would do something like this.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:31.540
She's rather elusive.

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:33.700
She's exceptionally skilled
 at hiding her presence,

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:36.240
so she can approach and 
rummage through things silently.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.070
Hey.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:38.650
What is this?

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:42.560
Wh-When did you get in here?

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:43.820
Mizushima-senpai!

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:46.280
What? This is the treasurer?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.200
I'm back.

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:54.420
Mizushima-senpai!

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:58.590
Hey, Tanahashi-san, 
what is this? What is it?

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:01.340
Th-That's the president's Hu—

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.760
Tanahashi-san!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.600
"Hu"? "Hu" what?

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.530
<i>Fool her.</i>

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:10.020
<i>Fool her.</i>

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.490
H-Hu—

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:16.560
It's a self-portrait of Baron Hug-Hug!

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:17.580
<i>Who?!</i>

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:18.650
<i>And he's a baron?!</i>

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.440
What is that baron's
 self-portrait doing here?

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:23.700
<i>Say something about 
the fact he's a baron.</i>

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:28.120
H-He's an important figure and guardian
 angel of student council activities!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:30.540
<i>Stop, Tanahashi!</i>

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:33.860
So, that's why he's 
wearing a school uniform.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.670
<i>She accepted it?</i>

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:38.110
What an impressive explanation.

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:39.000
<i>Oh, come on.</i>

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.760
<i>Am I wrong to be the only one 
calling her explanation stupid?</i>

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:43.580
He's got a weird face, though.

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:44.840
Weird?!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:46.740
Huggy is based on my ideal—

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:47.600
You idiot!

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:48.760
"My?"

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:51.750
My... my...

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:54.510
My parents and I were on a journey,

00:20:54.510 --> 00:20:59.320
when a mysterious merchant 
encouraged us to buy an expensive...

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.240
<i>Don't add to her explanation!</i>

00:20:58.240 --> 00:20:59.320
<i>And why the English?!</i>

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.630
Expensive?

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:02.530
In other words, it's valuable?

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.740
<i>She's taking this in the wrong direction!</i>

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:06.400
In that case, we should sell this.

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:09.170
I need to go show this to some people.

00:21:09.170 --> 00:21:09.990
Wait!

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.910
You can't do that.

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:13.030
Why not?

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:14.540
Is there some reason I shouldn't?

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:17.880
<i>She's pretending to be an 
idiot to get information?</i>

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:20.140
Come on, just for a little bit.

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:23.040
It'll make him less effective 
as a protective deity.

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:24.680
Fine, then.

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:26.050
I give up!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.050
Huggy!

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:29.550
Watch out!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.230
Are you all right, President?

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:41.020
You're way too desperate to save him.

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:43.680
I just threw the guardian 
angel of the student council.

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:45.640
But he'll forgive me, won't he?

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:47.590
After all, he's forgiven a member 
who doesn't do anything

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:50.120
and a vice president who will do anything.

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:51.910
<i>She really is behind this...</i>

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:53.840
See you later.

00:21:58.080 --> 00:22:00.000
And don't come back!

00:21:58.760 --> 00:22:00.000
Huggy.

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:05.400
Sayo said she'd go check it out,

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:06.950
but she's taking a long time.

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:08.720
Maybe they found h—

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:11.590
No, I'm not going to spy on them anymore.

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:13.410
I'm not a pervert!

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:14.580
Eno.

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:17.350
Sayo, how did it go?

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.150
I declared war.

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:20.390
Huh?

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:22.630
Wait, huh?

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:25.870
What?!

00:23:57.810 --> 00:24:03.610
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:58.350 --> 00:24:01.140
<i>As the third son of a poor noble family,</i>

00:24:01.140 --> 00:24:03.670
<i>he left home in search 
of dreams and romance.</i>

00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:07.880
<i>At the end of his various adventures, 
he arrived in an Eastern island country,</i>

00:24:07.880 --> 00:24:09.030
<i>Fuji Girls' Kingdom.</i>

00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:13.100
<i>There, he met a group of beautiful 
princesses embroiled in a fierce battle</i>

00:24:13.100 --> 00:24:16.100
<i>and impressively shattered 
the designs of an evil witch.</i>

00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:17.850
<i>Hey, what are you guys talking about?</i>

00:24:17.850 --> 00:24:19.570
<i>The story of Baron Hug-Hug,</i>

00:24:19.570 --> 00:24:22.210
<i>prior to becoming the guardian 
angel of the student council.</i>

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:26.130
<i>I guess there are people who put needless
 details into meaningless back stories.</i>

00:24:23.920 --> 00:24:27.150
<b>Sayo and Eno Declare War</b>

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:30.140
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
